# PC card team-portfolio (BENCH-231): the screen's A/A arm bb on all 46 teams, 6 seeds from 15000, 12 rounds, against master (the aa build). Template: the card's prep writes the work copy with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
6
--seed-base
15000
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
team-census46.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@bb
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-portfolio-@V@-bb
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-portfolio-bb.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
